# Documentation & Comments Language

All documentation and code comments MUST be in **International English**.

## Documentation

Applies to all `.md`/`.mdx` files in `packages/docs/`, READMEs, architecture docs, API docs, user guides.

## Code Comments

Applies to inline (`//`), block (`/* */`), JSDoc (`/** */`), TODO/FIXME comments.

## Exceptions

- Git commit messages (Conventional Commits на русском, see `git-rules` rule)
- User-facing UI content (strings, error messages for end users)
- Test fixtures for i18n testing
